---
const title = "Mas'uliyatli O'yin (18+) — Aviator Uzbek";
const description = "Qimor o'yinlariga qaramlikning oldini olish, 18+ yosh chegarasi va Aviator o'yinida xavfsiz o'ynash qoidalari.";
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>{title}</title>
  <meta name="description" content={description} />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://aviator-uzbek.online/masuliyatli-oyin/" />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://aviator-uzbek.online/masuliyatli-oyin/" />
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="uz" href="https://aviator-uzbek.online/masuliyatli-oyin/" />
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="ru" href="https://aviator-uzbek.online/ru-otvetstvennaya-igra/" />
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="https://aviator-uzbek.online/masuliyatli-oyin/" />
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://aviator-uzbek.online/og-preview.png" />
  <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200" />
  <meta property="og:image:height" content="630" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
  <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://aviator-uzbek.online/og-preview.png" />
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
    body { background-color: #0b0e14; color: #f1f5f9; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; min-height: 100vh; padding-bottom: 90px; display: flex; justify-content: center; }
    .app-wrapper { max-width: 460px; width: 100%; margin: 0 auto; padding: 14px 14px 20px; background-color: #0b0e14; }
    .top-bar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 900; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; }
    .lang-bar { display: flex; gap: 6px; }
    .lang-btn { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; padding: 5px 11px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; color: #94a3b8; background: #171d28; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); }
    .lang-btn.active { background: #007aff; color: #ffffff; border-color: #007aff; }
    .hero-card { background: linear-gradient(145deg, #0738b8 0%, #0056e0 50%, #007aff 100%); border-radius: 24px; padding: 22px 18px 20px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 16px; box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 86, 224, 0.28); }
    .hero-tag { display: inline-block; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); color: #ffffff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .hero-title { font-size: 21px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.25; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .content-card { background: #141a24; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 20px; padding: 18px 16px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .content-card h2 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .content-card p { font-size: 13px; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .content-card p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    footer { text-align: center; font-size: 11px; color: #475569; margin-top: 24px; padding: 16px 0 20px; }
    footer a { color: #64748b; text-decoration: underline; margin: 0 6px; }
    .bottom-bar { position: fixed; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0; background: #0f141d; border-top: 1px solid #1c2433; height: 64px; display: flex; justify-content: space-around; align-items: center; z-index: 100; max-width: 460px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .bottom-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-decoration: none; color: #708096; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; gap: 3px; flex: 1; }
    .bottom-item.active { color: #007aff; }
    .bottom-icon { font-size: 18px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app-wrapper">
    <header class="top-bar">
      <a href="/" class="logo"><span>✈️</span><span>Aviator UZ</span></a>
      <div class="lang-bar">
        <span class="lang-btn active">🇺🇿 O'zbek</span>
        <a href="/ru-otvetstvennaya-igra/" class="lang-btn">🇷🇺 Русский</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="hero-card">
      <div class="hero-tag">🛡️ Mas'uliyatli O'yin</div>
      <h1 class="hero-title">Mas'uliyatli o'yin (18+)</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);">Qimor o'yinlariga faqat ko'ngilochar vosita sifatida qarang. Xavfsiz o'yin qoidalari va 18+ cheklovi.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="content-card">
      <h2>1. 18+ yosh chegarasi</h2>
      <p>Aviator va boshqa qimor o'yinlarida ishtirok etish faqat 18 yoshga to'lgan shaxslar uchun ruxsat etiladi. Voyaga yetmaganlarning platformalardan foydalanishi taqiqlanadi.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="content-card">
      <h2>2. Pul va vaqt nazorati</h2>
      <p>O'yinga faqat yo'qotish og'riqli bo'lmagan summani ajrating. Qarzga olingan yoki oilaviy byudjetga mo'ljallangan pullarni hech qachon tikmang.</p>
      <p>Oldindan aniq limit qo'ying: kuniga ko'pi bilan 30-40 daqiqa va ma'lum bir maksimal yo'qotish chegarasi.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="content-card">
      <h2>3. Qaramlik belgilari paydo bo'lsa</h2>
      <p>Agar o'yin hayotingizga, ishingizga yoki munosabatlaringizga salbiy ta'sir ko'rsatayotganini his qilsangiz, zudlik bilan o'yinni to'xtating va o'z-o'zini cheklash funksiyasidan foydalaning.</p>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
        <a href="/masuliyatli-oyin/">Mas'uliyatli o'yin (18+)</a>
        <a href="/maxfiylik-siyosati/">Maxfiylik siyosati</a>
      </div>
      © 2026 Aviator Uzbek. 18+ Mas'uliyat bilan o'ynang.
    </footer>
  </div>

  <nav class="bottom-bar">
    <a href="/" class="bottom-item"><span class="bottom-icon">🏠</span><span>Asosiy</span></a>
    <a href="/go/1win" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored" class="bottom-item"><span class="bottom-icon">✈️</span><span>Aviator</span></a>
    <a href="/ilova/" class="bottom-item"><span class="bottom-icon">📲</span><span>APK</span></a>
    <a href="/uzcard-depozit/" class="bottom-item"><span class="bottom-icon">💳</span><span>To'lov</span></a>
    <a href="/go/1win" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored" class="bottom-item"><span class="bottom-icon">🎁</span><span>Bonus</span></a>
  </nav>
</body>
</html>
